# 📌 Key Features

* ✅ Teacher and student management
* ✅ Student-teacher assignment mapping
* ✅ Assignment creation
* ✅ Background notification processing
* ✅ BullMQ job queue
* ✅ Redis Pub/Sub
* ✅ Real-time Socket.IO notifications
* ✅ Persistent notification storage
* ✅ Dockerized backend services
* ✅ Separate API and worker processes

---

# 🎯 Project Goal

The main goal of **ClassPlus Backend** is to demonstrate how a backend can use **queues, workers, Redis Pub/Sub and WebSockets together** to build a reliable real-time notification system.

Instead of processing every notification directly inside the API request, notification processing is moved to a **background worker**, making the API more responsive and the architecture easier to scale.

